  "slug": "check-if-a-string-contains-all-binary-codes-of-size-k",
  "title": "检查字符串是否包含所有长度为 K 的二进制串",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-021",
  "studyTags": [
    "哈希表",
    "字符串",
    "位运算",
    "滚动哈希"
  ],
  "summary": "判断二进制字符串是否把全部 2^k 种长度 k 二进制编码都作为子串包含。",
  "insight": "用 k 位滑动整数作为滚动编码，记录每个窗口；不同编码数达到 2^k 即成功。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "窗口数量不足 2^k 可直接失败",
    "滚动后必须用掩码保留低 k 位",
    "重叠子串同样计入"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "rolling-bit-window",
      "title": "滚动位窗口",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "把每个长度 k 子串映射为一个整数。",
      "steps": [
        "needed=1<<k，窗口数不足则 false",
        "value=(value<<1|bit)&mask，i>=k-1 时加入 seen",
        "seen.size==needed 时返回 true，结束返回 false"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(2^k)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/rolling-bit-window/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/rolling-bit-window/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/rolling-bit-window/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
